        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise to King Ortler</strong> is a turn-based, family-friendly board game with elements of strategy and randomness – inspired by classics like <i>Ludo</i>, but with far more interaction and variety. Move your characters across dynamic game boards, use items, and master unique maps with their own rules and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In campaign mode, you'll gradually unlock 8 different maps – each featuring new mechanics and challenges. Once unlocked, these maps become available in Free Play mode, where you can fully customize your match: Choose the number of players (1–4), assign human or AI opponents, and select your preferred map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special feature is the built-in <strong>name editor</strong>, allowing you to give your characters custom names to bring your matches to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Turn-based board game with elements of strategy and randomness </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ 8 unlockable maps with unique rules and special tiles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Items and events that dynamically change the course of the game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍‍♂️ Up to 4 human or AI players in local multiplayer (including Remote Play Together) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✏️ Custom character naming via the integrated name editor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👪 Family-friendly visuals – colorful, humorous, and featuring lighthearted fantasy action</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise to King Ortler</strong> is a turn-based, family-friendly board game with elements of strategy and randomness – inspired by classics like <i>Ludo</i>, but with far more interaction and variety. Move your characters across dynamic game boards, use items, and master unique maps with their own rules and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In campaign mode, you'll gradually unlock 8 different maps – each featuring new mechanics and challenges. Once unlocked, these maps become available in Free Play mode, where you can fully customize your match: Choose the number of players (1–4), assign human or AI opponents, and select your preferred map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special feature is the built-in <strong>name editor</strong>, allowing you to give your characters custom names to bring your matches to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔑 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Turn-based board game with elements of strategy and randomness </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ 8 unlockable maps with unique rules and special tiles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Items and events that dynamically change the course of the game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍‍♂️ Up to 4 human or AI players in local multiplayer (including Remote Play Together) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✏️ Custom character naming via the integrated name editor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👪 Family-friendly visuals – colorful, humorous, and featuring lighthearted fantasy action</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A turn-based game inspired by classic board games – featuring 8 unlockable maps, items, special tiles, a campaign, free play mode, and a name editor for your characters. Supports up to 4 players or AI in local multiplayer. Colorful, fun, and family-friendly.",
